function rules(){modal(`<div class="eyebrow">THE CAPTAIN’S CODE</div><h2>Claim the greatest fortune.</h2><p>After 15 rounds, the captain with the most gold wins. Sail into the storm to grow the shared treasure chest—or harbor before the sea takes your share.</p><ol class="how-to-play"><li><strong>Begin in Calm Waters.</strong> Seats stay fixed. A random captain starts round one; the starting turn passes left each round, skipping eliminated captains. Each round starts with three safe draws. Nobody can harbor yet, and cards use their safe values.</li><li><strong>Draw, then decide.</strong> Resolve the next captain’s card. Afterward, decide whether to stay for another draw or harbor.</li><li><strong>Collect the full pot.</strong> Harboring gives you the current chest value; it is not divided between players. You leave the storm until the next round.</li><li><strong>Risk your ships.</strong> Whirlpools and Marooned can cost a ship and your gold. Your captain’s power and event cards can help.</li><li><strong>Finish your voyage.</strong> After round 15, add remaining ship and token values. The unique captain with the most ships receives the 100-gold Smooth Sailor bonus.</li></ol><div class="rule-menu"><button class="ghost" data-action="power-library">Player powers</button><button class="ghost" data-action="card-library">Play cards</button></div>`)}
